<section class="source-doc-transcript">
  <h2 id="foreword">Foreword</h2>

  <p>Who, among us, has not looked at the heavens<br>
  And pondered the questions; "Why am I here?"<br>
  "What is my purpose in life?"</p>

  <p>We are here because our parents were instructed<br>
  To go forth and multiply. The didn't know their<br>
  Multiplication tables so they sat down in total<br>
  Frustration until one finally exclaimed "Well,<br>
  We better do something even if it's wrong."</p>

  <p>Our purpose in life, therefore, must be to teach<br>
  Future parents the multiplication tables.</p>
</section>

