<p class="source-doc-note"><em>Jack Fleming is also named in the Introduction of "Once Around the Thunder Mug," where he is prospecting with Noel Roberts, "only a round away from bonanzas." Fred Gulzow appears in "Echoes from the Thundermug," in <a href="/writings/echoes-from-the-thundermug/married-life-and-mining-camps-part-four/#prospectors-were-a-visionary-lot-who-built-the-west">"Prospectors Were a Visionary Lot Who Built the West."</a></em></p>
